          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 201,
          "line_start": 191,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L191-L201"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b514720286be761084f1f947911b985f3bbf639cef6b27abe77dcde35f1deb04",
        "slc_d7eab85b76d4c99efd9ebb32ebb36c5d60befad0a9e55738cc990a42439fcde9"
      ],
      "text": "Besides MCP tools, Concord offers a CLI (setup, status, dashboard, who, tasks, handoff, review-packet, export, doctor, adapters status) operating on the same shared workspace."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_b1c6343914e410896c5e4ee6937a85cd6088beb07fe5867e77596b452c52c445",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 137,
          "line_start": 130,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L130-L137"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_459685a2cf7c198042efc027264af357ff3c5baf34baed61150f82fc9eb220b9"
      ],
      "text": "Agent-to-agent prompts use update_work with operation \"prompt\", a to_agent_id, content, and idempotency_key; replies use operation \"reply\" with reply_to_message_id."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_9082783e8004127566c87c8d7ee790f38f890473fec3b6becb81e9fc8cd2f5a4",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 162,
          "line_start": 157,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L157-L162"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_50dc98e6230e4b2e55aa76c8edaa7cb5055b054ce8ace1e0b839699a78574d24"
      ],
      "text": "SQLite in the repo-root .concord/ directory is the local source of truth; the root is resolved from CONCORD_REPO_ROOT, then CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR, then the working directory, so agents in one repo share one store."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_dd3337486c17d78b768c84b25445f138775744bf0bcfe8bad4686c4d37ee7a94",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 183,
          "line_start": 177,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L177-L183"
        },
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
