          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L172-L175"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a9ccda6189381572434bee20f77441c4bad3d5c049dce8d005a4623aa1cd7024",
        "slc_f170f44b908ef769936746b87818ac3d916d5c48a8abdf6645c5ba782dede628"
      ],
      "text": "The .concord/ workspace holds concord.db, HANDOFF.md, REVIEW_PACKET.md, and an optional WORK_STATE.json export; setup gitignores the directory so it stays local by default."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_89aa6cdd2162c79a7f25bb0eed3b0c9b53dd2c6fb088d412a5f2f7edddf8c75e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 153,
          "line_start": 148,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L148-L153"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_64a23ba1db03e6264c2466c2fa7efb2e5c4264c1170e41550b652f3fbe89b504"
      ],
      "text": "Lifecycle-changing operations use the task's monotonic version as expected_version, so of two agents acting on the same version only the first transition succeeds; ownership changes are kept in an append-only audit history."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_67bb37c8a7515cbbf62772910001b991f80b70438b022c63a59069dcd1ebe5ad",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 137,
          "line_start": 130,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L130-L137"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_459685a2cf7c198042efc027264af357ff3c5baf34baed61150f82fc9eb220b9"
      ],
      "text": "Delivery fails immediately when the named agent has no reachable endpoint rather than silently rerouting; hook-only integrations leave a durable pull message and state that limitation in the result."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_791d497129e7081ea5165b5dc4bb0574e5e1e7f24cf5af61968f5e1aa7a1be6e",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 268,
          "line_start": 262,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L262-L268"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_df18160a08e2707e1e4c5903e665a7992153f909e4a16a922c46b889e5bdb436"
      ],
      "text": "Telemetry is sent to getconcord.ai but excludes code, paths, identifiers, and message content; CONCORD_TELEMETRY_DISABLED=1 or DO_NOT_TRACK=1 disables it, and delivery is best-effort so it can never fail an operation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f2153a3de9b07a225994ed0018bec4e003653fcd097d5f65a7b5f7cff4406b82",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3",
          "git_sha": "c5398fee141ee4bb0cf360d89981b4302a093030",
          "line_end": 232,
          "line_start": 230,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "get-concord-ai/concord-mcp",
          "url": "https://github.com/Get-Concord-AI/concord-mcp/blob/d2408b0cbce5c24f9fd85ead5ec23522fbeea0e3/README.md#L230-L232"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_c0c60e8e9a445b7ed0d659bb9049514a428eea3519bc466e0779945c0d2b2f42"
      ],
      "text": "The README states Concord is not an orchestrator, code reviewer, hosted sync service, memory vector DB, or autonomous coding agent — it is a shared work-state layer for agents in the same local checkout."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3be86c5d68e9296651c8470c1b9d8d231f1ef0dbdcb7231c0692eead852bd82d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "limitations",
