        "slc_d407f6c08c8ee0f0847f58e03716394dcbb94e0cc67de1456a9869f44442e002"
      ],
      "text": "There is no universal /concord slash command; integration is via MCP tools plus installed per-client instructions, and live delivery depends on the receiving harness and session state."
    },
